 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Isekai No Ochibi-chan wa Kyou mo Nanika wo Tsukuri Dasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "異世界のおチビちゃんは今日も何かを創り出す～スキル【想像創造】で目指せ成り上がり！～"
   },
   {
    "en": "Ochibi-chan from Another World Creates Something Again Today ~ Using the Skill [Imagination Creation] to Aim for Success! ~\""
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "One day, Ochibi (5 years old) who lives in the slums suddenly remembers that she has been reincarnated from another world. Ochibi has the \"Imagination Creation\" skill, which allows her to create anything she imagines. She decides to start a business with the Japanese items she obtains with her \"Imagination Creation\" skill! A heartwarming story with a boy named \"Onii\" and a girl named \"Nene\" who aim to escape the slums!!",
   "ja": "ある日突然、自分が異世界から転生したことを思い出した、スラム暮らしのおチビ（5歳）。 おチビは、想像したものを作り出せる「想像創造」スキルを持っていた。 「想像創造」スキルで手に入れた日本のアイテムで、商売を始めることに！ 少年「おにぃ」と少女「ねぇね」とともに、スラム脱出を目指す、ハートフルストーリー!!"
  },
